 the data is present in the cache, it is returned to the application. If th=
e data is not found in the cache, it is retrieved from its original source,=
 stored in the cache for future use, and then returned to the application. =
In a distributed system, caching can occur in multiple locations, including=
 the client, DNS, CDN, load balancer, API gateway, server, database, and mo=
re.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class=3D"MuiBox-root css-7e1k6b">=
